        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CPA tax document classifier\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nWatches the shared client folder. Each new file is downloaded, its text extracted, and a classifier sorts it: W-2 / 1099, K-1, receipts and expenses, or other.\n\nEach document type has its own extraction schema. Anything below the confidence threshold — and anything the classifier can't place — goes to an accountant's review queue instead of being filed.\n\nFiled documents move to the client folder and update the practice-management work item.",
